docs {
  # GET /health

  Liveness probe. Returns `200 OK` with `{"status": "ok"}` as long as
  the API process is alive. Does not currently ping downstream
  dependencies (Milvus / Neo4j / Postgres / Temporal) — keep
  polling cheap so it doesn't crowd the LLM proxy.

  **Auth:** none.
}
